   "body": "#878 (merged as 413cfdf7) likely fixes this too. The reader read its safe area under `.ignoresSafeArea`, so the web view got a top inset of 0. With the fix it gets the bar's height, so the first post should land below the top bar. A device check is left: open a topic, then a one-post topic, on iPhone and iPad. If it holds, close this issue with that observation. If not, the top edge has another cause.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
